{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "Min Ragan-Kelley <benjaminrk@gmail.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Intended Audience :: Developers", "Operating System :: MacOS", "Programming Language :: Python", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3"], "description": "# `appnope`\n\nSimple package for disabling App Nap on macOS >= 10.9,\nwhich can be problematic.\n\nTo disable App Nap for the current process:\n\n```python\nimport appnope\nappnope.nope()\n```\n\nTo reenable, for some reason:\n\n```python\nappnope.nap()\n```\n\nor to only disable App Nap for a particular block:\n\n```\nwith appnope.nope_scope():\n    do_important_stuff()\n```\n\nIt uses ctypes to wrap a `[NSProcessInfo beginActivityWithOptions]` call to disable App Nap.\n\nTo install:\n\n    pip install appnope\n", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": "BSD-2-Clause", "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "appnope", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/appnope/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/appnope/", "project_urls": {"Source": "https://github.com/minrk/appnope"}, "provides_extra": null, "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/appnope/1.0.0/", "requires_dist": null, "requires_python": ">=3.9", "summary": "Disable App Nap on macOS >= 10.9", "version": "1.0.0", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "releases": {"0.1.4": [{"comment_text": "", "core-metadata": {"sha256": "eb41cc5f94eb413d2864ffa185c845603e6d4881490b9171fa025c00fb968f5f"}, "digests": {"blake2b_256": "81295ecc3a15d5a33e31b26c11426c45c501e439cb865d0bff96315d86443b78", "md5": "fce1c130bea358b149830d18dc7c0607", "sha256": "502575ee11cd7a28c0205f379b525beefebab9d161b7c964670864014ed7213c"}, "downloads": -1, "filename": "appnope-0.1.4-py2.py3-none-any.